                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-07"><hi rendition="#italic">October 7,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that an edict of 28th September orders Prince Tuan banished,
                    Princes Chuang I and Duke Lan imprisoned for life, and Ying Men Kang I and Chao
                    Shu-Chiao forthwith decapitated. Adds that Earl Li is expected in Pekin on the
                    9th.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
